{"4918300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Wheelchair Man 2", "steam_appid": 4918300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been a few months since your last score. You have set your eyes on a new apartment complex, home to many who have taken advantage of the location to operate their shady businesses. Tonight is the perfect opportunity to steal from them as a famous singer is in town and most people should be out for the night. However a familiar foe is waiting for you there to get his revenge...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to steal as much money from the building as possible and get out alive. Search through boxes, barrels and trash to find cash or break into  risky areas to get money. The longer you stay, the more dangerous it becomes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scope and features of this game has been greatly improved from the Wheelchair Man 1. A larger and more detailed level, more unique upgrades, more ways to get money, More terrifying enemy  behavior, and new characters and enemies! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game with a friend, help each other reach the money goal and run from the wheelchair man or play against them in a competitive mode where only 1 person can escape! <br><br>(I am still working on this game, pictures and features may change)</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been a few months since your last score. You have set your eyes on a new apartment complex, home to many who have taken advantage of the location to operate their shady businesses. Tonight is the perfect opportunity to steal from them as a famous singer is in town and most 